      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the paraboloid, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z+2 & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(0+3)^{2}}{3} \\\\ z+2 & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{9}{3} \\\\ z+2 & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-3 \\\\ z+5 & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2} \\\\ {x}^{2} & =2(z+5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThis gives us the equation of the parabola in $xz$-plane.",
